{
  "headline": "FDA's records trace our supply to a plant classified OAI 262 days before the posting",
  "headline_cites": ["D6"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "Potassium acetate has been on FDA's shortage list since 2019-06-10 and remains listed as of 2026-10-21, a duration of 88 months.",
      "cites": ["D11"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The product label for NDC 00409818301 names Hospira, Inc. as labeler and identifies two registered plants: Hospira, Inc. (FEI 1021343, USA) and Pfizer Healthcare India Private Limited (FEI 3008316085, India).",
      "cites": ["E16", "E25"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA inspection 1006274 at the Pfizer India plant ended 2017-03-17 and was classified VAI, 815 days before the shortage posting.",
      "cites": ["D4", "E20"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA inspection 1039547 at the same plant ended 2018-02-02 and was classified VAI, 493 days before the posting.",
      "cites": ["D5", "E21"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA inspection 1066469 at the Pfizer India plant ended 2018-09-21 and was classified VAI, 262 days before the posting.",
      "cites": ["D6", "E21"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA inspection 1106244 at the Pfizer India plant ended 2019-09-06 and was classified OAI, with the classification letter dated 2020-05-25, 88 days after the posting.",
      "cites": ["D7", "E22"]
    },
    {
      "text": "A Warning Letter was issued to Pfizer Healthcare India Private Limited on 2020-03-25, 289 days after the posting.",
      "cites": ["D9", "E24"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The Hospira, Inc. plant (FEI 1021343) has a history of OAI classifications in 2010 and 2011, with its most recent inspection classified NAI on 2025-02-07.",
      "cites": ["E6", "E8", "E10", "E16"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Current inventory across three sites ranges from 12.7 to 22.8 days on hand for the 3.93 g/20 mL presentation.",
      "cites": ["D1", "D2", "D3"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The rule-based best option is to buy from Exela Pharma Sciences, LLC, which is not on FDA's shortage list today, though its label names no plant we could place.",
      "cites": ["D12"]
    }
  ]
}
